{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55355","headline":"重开衡阳寺古迹诗刻 · 齐己　牟儒","name":"重开衡阳寺古迹诗刻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古迹重闻一朗兴，斸烟寻得宝阶层。\n只应云鹤知前事，爲问齐梁旧住僧。\n废井荒池犹浸月，短松低栢欲遮灯。\n淳于道士真高达，抛却林泉便上昇。\n（见《至元金陵新志》卷十一「衡阳寺」条引《庆元志》。\n）（按：《庆元志》云：「寺旧有齐己、牟儒二上人《重开衡阳寺古迹诗刻》云〖诗略〗。\n保大七年题。\n」唐诗僧齐己卒於天福初，未活至保大年，今亦无证可定爲一人，姑分列。\n《全唐诗》无牟儒诗。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己　牟儒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}